                    US–USSR Relations, 1981–1990, Lot 93D188, Reagan/Shultz/Gorbachev/Shevardnadze
                    in Reykjavik, October 1986. Secret; Sensitive. The meeting took place in Hofdi
                    House.</p>
            </note>
